tensorflow/lite: fp16 headers also without GPU, NNAPI and XNNPACK.

In TF 2.20 kernels (e.g. kernels/embedding_lookup.cc) include "fp16/fp16.h" unconditionally, while
tensorflow/lite/CMakeLists.txt adds fp16_headers only for TFLITE_ENABLE_GPU, _TFLITE_ENABLE_NNAPI and
TFLITE_ENABLE_XNNPACK. With all three off the build fails. find_package(fp16_headers) is added next to the
other required dependencies; the source is FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_FP16_HEADERS.

--- a/tensorflow/lite/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/tensorflow/lite/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -175,6 +175,8 @@
 endif()
 find_package(cpuinfo REQUIRED)  #CPUINFO is used by XNNPACK and RUY library
 find_package(ml_dtypes REQUIRED)
+# kernels/ include fp16/fp16.h unconditionally, not only with GPU/NNAPI/XNNPACK
+find_package(fp16_headers REQUIRED)
 find_package(ruy REQUIRED)
 # Include TSL, which is in tensorflow/third_party
 include_directories(
